# The cover screen (cover-up, cover-side), where settings is a sheet over Tasks and the call: each
# tap snapped right after it lands and shot once it settles. Also the Tasks button's ring through
# Tasks, Calls and a project page, a stage switch, and unfolding with settings up.
launch hexvoice:///
wait 3
shoot call
tap tasks-button
snap tasks-tap
shoot tasks
selected tasks-button
tap Working,
snap stage-tap
wait 0.2
snap stage-tap-later
shoot stage
tap Done,
snap stage-done-tap
shoot stage-done
tap Quiet,
snap stage-quiet-tap
shoot stage-quiet
tap Needs you,
snap stage-needs-tap
shoot stage-needs
tap markdown
snap chat-tap
wait 0.3
snap chat-tap-later
shoot chat
tap task-back
snap chat-back-tap
shoot chat-back
tap voice-settings-button
snap settings-tap
wait 0.3
snap settings-tap-later
shoot settings
swipe-down voice-settings-sheet
tap tasks-button
shoot tasks-closed
unselected tasks-button
tap voice-settings-button
snap settings-from-call-tap
wait 0.3
snap settings-from-call-tap-later
shoot settings-from-call
swipe-down voice-settings-sheet
shoot settings-closed
tap calls-button
snap calls-tap
wait 0.3
snap calls-tap-later
shoot calls
tap calls-button
snap calls-closed-tap
shoot calls-closed
# Unfolding with settings up moves it into its place, where Tasks swaps in with one tap.
tap voice-settings-button
shoot fold-settings
pose open-up
shoot unfolded-settings
